  "title": "交大安泰|2026年优才夏令营报名通知",
  "html": "<div>\n<section>\n<section><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/articles/media/7211495d4b5439f05ec9.png\"/></section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section></section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section></section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><span><strong><span>交大安泰</span></strong></span><span><strong><span><br/></span><span><span>2026年优才夏令营</span></span></strong></span><strong><span><br/></span><span><span>全面启动</span></span></strong></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section></section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section></section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><strong><span>关于安泰</span></strong></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/articles/media/e16285588ef69aed5e42.jpg\"/></section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/articles/media/0eed291347437ac64b05.png\"/></section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>上海交通大学安泰经济与管理学院是一所国内领先、亚洲一流、国际知名的商学院。1901年的“经济特科班”和1918年的 “铁路管理科”，是学院建设的起点。经过百年的发展，上海交通大学安泰经济与管理学院已稳居中国最顶尖商学院方阵。交大安泰是国内首家同时获得AMBA、EQUIS、AACSB三大国际权威认证的商学院，拥有全国顶尖的生源和教学科研团队，并在上海、深圳、新加坡构建了国际化办学格局。如今，进入第二个百年征程的交大安泰，正以“纵横交错、知行合一”战略为指导，迈上了建设“扎根中国的世界级商学院”的登峰之路。</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>学院在国内外各类学科排名中成绩卓越。在全球最具影响力大学排名之一的英国QS“2023年世界大学学科排名”中，上海交通大学安泰经济与管理学院相关的四个学科，全部进入全球60强。其中会计与金融位列全球第39名、商业与管理位列全球第32名、统计与运筹位列全球第43名、经济学与计量经济学位列全球第56名。在教育部最新的学科评估排名中，学院的工商管理学科获评A+，管理科学与工程学科获评A+，应用经济学获评A。在教育部第二轮“双一流”学科建设名单中，我院工商管理学科再度入选。</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section></section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section></section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><strong><span>学科排名</span></strong></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/articles/media/6fb8af0b322fc61fc850.png\"/></section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/articles/media/b1530b45c46f4ae95384.png\"/></section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/articles/media/2e4ada07361748b97ca3.png\"/></section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/articles/media/6a9b78ebf8c20525ff00.png\"/></section>\n</section>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><strong><span>安</span><span><span>泰优才营举办时间和形式</span></span></strong></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><span><span>上海交通大学安泰经管学院第二十届（2026入学）安泰优才营将于2025年夏季举办，分为会计专硕营、学术营（学硕、直博）、金融硕士营，将采用线下方式举办（如有变化另行通知）。</span></span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</section>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span><span>优才营</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>名称</span></span></strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span><span>举办</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>时间</span></span></strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span><span>可申请</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span><span>可申请的</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>研究方向</span></span></strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong><span><span>学制</span></span></strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>金融</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>夏令营</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>7月</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>11-13</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>金融专硕</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>行业研究与产业金融</span></span><span><span>、金融科技与量化投资、科创金融</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>会计</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>夏令营</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>13-15</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>会计专硕</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>不区分研</span></span><span><span>究方向</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">\n<p><span><span><span><span>学硕</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>夏令营</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">\n<p><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>8-10</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>工商管理学</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>不区分研究方向</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>2.5</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>管理科学</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>与工程</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>不区分研究方向</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>2.5</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>应用经济学</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>经济学</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>2.5</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">\n<p><span><span><span><span>直博</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>夏令营</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">\n<p><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>8-11</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>工商管理学</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>企业战略管理、市场营销与战略、供应链与物流管理、组织行为和人力资源管理、会计与公司治理等</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>管理科学</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>与工程</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>金融工程及风险管理、优化与运作管理、信息系统及管理、技术创新及管理、大数据计算与挖掘等</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>应用经济学</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>金融学、产业经济学、国际经济与贸易、数量经济学、农业经济学、区域经济与城市经济等</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<section>\n<p><span><span>注：</span></span></p>\n</section>\n<p><span><span>1、以上时间安排如有变动，以后续通知为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2、各项目夏令营因时间临近，只能申请其中的一个专业或方向。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3、上海交大安泰经管学院将根据教育部和学校相关政策保留最终解释权。</span></span></p>\n</section>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><strong><span><span>报名方式</span></span></strong></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><span><span>夏令营（会计专硕、学硕、直博）在安泰经济与管理学院考生系统中统一报名，网址为https://apply.acem.sjtu.edu.cn/postgraduate/login，报名截止时间为2025年7月3日上午10点整。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>金融硕士营在中银科技金融学院网报系统中统一报名，网址为https://applyitf.sjtu.edu.cn/apply/jrzs/#/login，报名截止时间为2025年7月3日上午10点整。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>请同学们注意截止时间，不接受逾期报名。报名提交后将不可修改，请上传最终版材料。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>获得交大安泰优才营入营资格的营员，需登录上海交通大学研究生网申系统（ga.sjtu.edu.cn/zsgl/xlygl）进行填报，具体流程请查看邮件通知。</span></span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><strong><span>申请资格</span></strong></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><span><span>1、拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2、本科三年级在校生（2026年应届毕业生），专业不限（欢迎跨专业报考）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3、能获得本科所在院校的推免研究生资格；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4、本科阶段学习成绩优秀，英语合格（CET6≥425或TOEFL≥90或IELTS≥6.0）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>其他相关要求按《上海交通大学2026年招收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含直博）办法》执行</span></span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section></section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section></section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><strong><span><span>会计硕士营、学硕夏令营、直博夏令营</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>安泰经管学院教务办公室</span></span></span><span><br/></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>地  址：上海市徐汇区华山路1954号，上海交大安泰经济与管理学院B301室</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>邮  编：200030</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>电  话：021-52305272 (会计专硕)、52301352 (直博、学硕)、52301031</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>邮  箱：acem.zhaosheng@sjtu.edu.cn</span></span></span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><strong><span><span>金融硕士营</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>上海交大中银科技金融学院教学服务中心</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>地  址：上海市</span></span><span><span><span>徐汇区</span></span></span><span><span>华山路1954号，上海交通大学浩然高科技大厦605室</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>电  话：021-62933105、021-62933016</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>邮  箱：itf.mf@sjtu.edu.cn</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span> </span></span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><strong><span>热烈期盼各校优秀学子，相聚上交！</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span> </span></strong></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section></section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section></section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section></section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/articles/media/256e8f74cb6c63788d1f.png\"/></section>\n<section><span> </span></section>\n<section><span> </span></section>\n<section><span> </span></section>\n<section><span> </span></section>\n<section><span> </span></section>\n</section>\n<p> </p>\n</div>",
